            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.6

- Added a General setting to show or hide the Calendar menu bar item.
- When Calendar is disabled, the app now stops Calendar refreshes, meeting reminder timers, meeting notifications, and clears active meeting reminder state.
- Calendar stays disabled after Google sign-in instead of refreshing in the background.

]]></description>
